# A Crisis in the Making (windurst 2): the other operands, by GM. Fame 49 (level 1), available: QuestCrisisMaking_var
# 1: Ranpi-Monpi's standard event (the var 1 reminders want accepted or completed); var 2: the same (267 / 268 want
# accepted / completed). The altar while available with var 1: its standard 60 (status 0 is not >= 1). Accepted at var
# 0: Ranpi-Monpi's accepted arm plays nothing (no event, no standard event). Accepted at var 1: the altar's 53, and its
# finish (option 1) after the quest was set available inside the event (GM) still gives the offering (the finish reads
# no status). Accepted at var 3 (GM): nothing (267 wants var 2); completed at var 3: his standard event (268 wants
# var 2).
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-122.0,-3.0,63.2 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Windurst 49
charvar QuestCrisisMaking_var 1
login
trigger Ranpi-Monpi                     # available, level 1, var 1: a standard event
finish
charvar QuestCrisisMaking_var 2
trigger Ranpi-Monpi                     # available, level 1, var 2: a standard event
finish
charvar QuestCrisisMaking_var 1
warp -133.0,17.0,180.0 Giddeus
trigger Altar_of_Offerings              # available, var 1: 60
finish
quest Windurst.ACrisisInTheMaking accepted
charvar QuestCrisisMaking_var 0
warp -122.0,-3.0,63.2 WindurstWaters
trigger Ranpi-Monpi                     # accepted, var 0: nothing
charvar QuestCrisisMaking_var 1
warp -133.0,17.0,180.0 Giddeus
trigger Altar_of_Offerings              # accepted, var 1: 53
quest Windurst.ACrisisInTheMaking available
finish option=1                         # the Off Offering; var 2 (no status read)
quest Windurst.ACrisisInTheMaking accepted
charvar QuestCrisisMaking_var 3
warp -122.0,-3.0,63.2 WindurstWaters
trigger Ranpi-Monpi                     # accepted, var 3: nothing
quest Windurst.ACrisisInTheMaking completed
trigger Ranpi-Monpi                     # completed, var 3: a standard event
finish
